Z||000003||theogre||09-30-2001||09:11 PM||||Never trust a dash gauge. hook up a mechanical gauge, is an ECM scanner, or even check at the Tsat housing with an IR or contact pyrometer, but Never trust a dash gauge. The wireing error that punds the hell out of it at startup is great fro knocking the needle out of place.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
